rrors().toString()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n        try {\n            int batch = payChecksService.batchReview(checkIds);\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.success(batch + \"条付款受理成功\"), HttpStatus.OK);\n        } catch (ServiceException e) {\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.fail(\"付款受理失败，原因：\" + e.getMessage()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 根据查询条件批量受理\n     *\n     * @param qo 查询条件\n     * @return\n     */\n    @PostMapping(\"/review_query\")\n    public ResponseEntity<Object> reviewByQuery(@RequestBody PayChecksQO qo) {\n        payStatusManager.setDefaultStatusIfNecessary(qo, PayOperation.REVIEW);\n        try {\n            int batch = payChecksService.reviewByQuery(qo);\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.success(batch + \"条付款受理成功\"), HttpStatus.OK);\n        } catch (ServiceException e) {\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.fail(\"付款受理失败，原因：\" + e.getMessage()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 下拉列表初始化\n     *\n     * @return\n     */\n    @PostMapping(\"/init_select\")\n    public ResponseEntity<Map<String, List<SelectDTO>>> initSelect() {\n        List<String> filteredStatus = payStatusManager.getReviewQueryDefaultStatus();\n        Map<String, List<SelectDTO>> selectDtoMap = paySelectInitComponent.getBasicSelectDtoMap(filteredStatus);\n\n        selectDtoMap.put(\"payGroup\", paySelectInitComponent.getPayGroup());\n        return new ResponseEntity<Map<String, List<SelectDTO>>>(selectDtoMap, HttpStatus.OK);\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * 付款拆分\n     *\n     * @return\n     */\n    @PostMapping(\"/pay_split\")\n    public ResponseEntity<Object> paySplit(@RequestBody @Validated PayCheckSplitDTO checkId, BindingResult result) {\n        log.info(\"拆分付款：{}\", checkId);\n        if (result.hasErrors()) {\n            return new ResponseEntity<>(ResponseMessage.fail(result.getAllErrors().toString()), HttpStatus.OK);\n        }\n     